  "notes": "4 Winds Wrestling's own first show. The recap package on the following Tempest names the falls: Shocker pinned Fagen Gilchrist; Syxx Figures eliminated Ben Jericho and Vinn Eversor; Patti Anderson pinned Shocker and then Syxx Figures; Jay Phoenix pinned Patti Anderson, Johnny Beckett, Nick Raynes and finally Jaime with the Firestorm to become the first North Wind Champion. Pajaro de Presa beat Psymon in a tables match and Patti Anderson pinned Bad Boi on the same card."
